  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172469/description_c106f3a0-0dfa-4947-8f42-956219e9a42a.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://discord.gg/XPHtcP89P3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_e4321bc8-03c3-43b7-8e7f-dc4e0c1f2fb8.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"73\"></a><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft-legendary-edition.gitbook.io%252fminecraft-legendary-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft-legendary-edition.gitbook.io%252fminecraft-legendary-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_ad94e309-9ad9-4b83-8307-9c2389b7a4db.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"73\"></a><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft-legendary-edition.gitbook.io%252fminecraft-legendary-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flegendaryworkshop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_79b8a6de-f9f6-4529-8b8e-db21f5cbad7e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"73\"></a><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft-legendary-edition.gitbook.io%252fminecraft-legendary-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MinecraftLegendaryEdition/featured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_f080cedc-12ef-442e-a021-6d3f7353b8cc.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"73\"></a></span></p><p><strong>傳奇標籤頁</strong> 引入了一種全新的可自定義方式，透過物品欄標籤頁來存取模組包選單。這個模組讓您能夠輕鬆導航至任何透過設定檔案配置的選單。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">目前已整合的標籤頁包括：&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Backpacked, Quark Oddities, FTB Quests, FTB Teams, Reskillable (Reimagined), Legendary Survival Overhaul, Map Atlases, Xaeros's map, Journey Map<br></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172469/description_c1b4cab4-6fe9-4600-ac62-8e65598df0fe.png\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>此模組是&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/minecraft-legendary-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Minecraft 傳奇版</em>&nbsp;模組包</a>&nbsp;的一部分！</strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>建議遊玩此模組包以獲得此模組的最佳體驗。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252flegendary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172469/description_f7ab851d-34bd-4638-8f98-b1ee3bc857c6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></p>",
